.TH "bead schema" 1  "bead schema " 
.SH NAME
bead schema \- Inspect public schemas
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead schema\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect the immutable public document\-schema catalog.
.PP
The catalog is workspace\-independent and is the same typed registry returned by `bead capabilities`.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
bead schema\-list(1)
List public schemas
.TP
bead schema\-show(1)
Show a public JSON Schema
.TP
bead schema\-explain(1)
Explain a public schema
.TP
bead schema\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
